      "content": "Thanks for that. You mentioned \"migrant populations\" in some of those areas like Brixton or East London as a factor for needing to stay on high alert. Can you elaborate on why those specific demographics make the environment more \"unpredictable\" or risky for a traveler? Is it a specific type of crime or just the general social atmosphere in those neighborhoods?",
